    {
      "id": "claim_aaadb6a88105419598971b6b2f6cd06c",
      "statement": "Cite-only mode hooks into Zotero.Integration.Session.prototype._insertCitingResult, the method that would otherwise insert cited annotations as a mock note (xpcom/integration.js:1678-1701, verified against Zotero 10.0.5); with the citationOnly preference on, the wrapper rewrites the citation and inserts it through the regular path _insertItemsIntoDocument() (integration.js:1778-1785) instead. insertAnnotations is not a patch point because it exists only on Zotero.EditorInstance, not on Integration.Session.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/anchors.md#L11-L11",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d36e1bc1d1d64f694e33913ba34a5b48ae1efd5cc7ca5cc5853fd78f41f2c67a:"
