      "id": "claim_9677b0366fbe42e5a9f972f71bc0276c",
      "statement": "refOf builds each AnnotationRef from the annotation: topLevelId only from a topLevelItem that isRegularItem() (otherwise null, logged as \"has no citable top-level item; falling back\"), pageLabel from annotationPageLabel, and locatorType from getLocator only when a page label exists; getLocator resolves the CSL locator type as the annotation's #flexannotate-locator-<type> tag, else the attachment's #flexannotate-default-locator-<type> tag, else page.",
