    {
      "id": "claim_e032c3f7f8ad48c3a4908c1fc7fac105",
      "statement": "The mode selector is a DOM injection (no prototype hooks in the citation dialog), registered as the modeSelector injector before the outline view; the shared dialog watcher calls injectModeSelector once per citation-dialog window after the dialog's own initialization and removeModeSelector on unload or plugin stop. It builds one label+select row per injection point (settings popup #settings-popup .popup and item-details popup #itemDetails .popup before its .buttons), keeps both selects in sync on change, is idempotent via the .flexannotate-citation-mode-row check, tags rows data-dialog-type=\"annotations\", styles via one injected style element, and localizes by attaching flexannotate-addon.ftl to the dialog document with a hardcoded German/English fallback.",
